Falsifies `timetable::proofs::a_range_is_exactly_its_steps`.

The defect: a range whose end is not its last step is accepted, so the product fires past the end a person wrote (`to 17:00 by 15m` also fires at 17:15, 17:30 and 17:45).

Expected to fail: the `assert_eq!(fires, in_range)`, at a time after `end` in the end hour.

